# A placed(...) to a lamp still finds it after test mode (fails today: "No block in this level has UID ...")
open-window
new-script Lights
place-block lamp as lamp
set-text
    toggler(1, targets: placed("{uid:lamp}"))
end
expect-no-errors
compile
expect-result Placed
place-start
test-mode
wait 2
back-to-editor
open-window
select-script Lights
wait 2
screenshot back-in-editor
expect-no-errors
